# The Umbral Deeps' cave life.

ent-WFMobCavernDeepBat = deep bat
    .desc = A black bat from the shadow groves. It is blind and keeps clear of you by its squeaks.

ent-WFMobCavernUmbralSpider = umbral spider
    .desc = A blind spider the colour of the chromite. It feels your footsteps through the rock and bites whatever it finds.

ent-WFMobCavernGeodeCrab = geode crab
    .desc = A crab grown from pink geode crystal. Break it open and the crystal inside spills out.

ent-WFUmbralCap = umbral cap
    .desc = A violet cap from the dark. Cook two with water in a big bowl for mushroom soup.

ent-WFPaleLichen = pale lichen
    .desc = A scrap of pale lichen that smells of medicine. Eat it for a little healing, or cut it up to bind on a wound.

ent-WFCavernUmbralCapPlant = umbral cap
    .desc = A violet mushroom that grows where the chromite is damp. Pick it and cook it.

ent-WFCavernPaleLichenPlant = pale lichen
    .desc = A crust of pale lichen on the bedrock. Cut it with a knife and it grows back.

ent-WFCavernGeodeCluster = geode cluster
    .desc = Pink crystal grown thick in a crack in the rock. A pickaxe or shovel chips shards off it, and it grows back.

ent-WFCavernGeodeBloom = geode bloom
    .desc = A pink geode that has grown too full. Walk up to it and it cracks, then bursts in sharp shards.

ent-WFCavernRadiantCrystal = radiant crystal
    .desc = A violet crystal that hums. It gives off more than light, so don't stand near it for long.

ent-WFCavernAcidSpitter = acid spitter
    .desc = A dark bulb on a thin stalk. It spits acid at anything that comes within sight of it.

wf-cavern-geode-cracks = The geode cracks open!
wf-cavern-geode-bursts = The geode bursts in a spray of shards!
